      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks, I see what you mean now. So this is about rendering HTML code that is _not_ inside a code block, like this:\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n  hello\n\u003c/div\u003e\nAnd this is text that immediately follows.\n\nSeems that the new `renderer.html` implementation does not respect that we want to keep the new lines (`breaks: true`). Will update and follow up. Great catch!",
